{
  "$Comment": "Martha's Roast, the best of Martha's three dishes: meat and vegetables roasted on a stick at a Chef's Stove (the Cookingbench, its Baked tab) once a player has learned it from Harvest_Feast_Recipe_Marthas_Roast, sold at her shop to those she counts Family. It wears the game's meat skewer (its model, texture and icon) and does everything the other two do: an instant heal, Harvest_Feast_Food_Regen (the game's top food regen, for ten minutes), Harvest_Feast_Food_Health and Harvest_Feast_Food_Stamina, and on top Harvest_Feast_Food_Favor, which makes Martha's favor come faster while it lasts. It clears the game's own food regens, meat buffs and fruit and vegetable buffs first. Its description in items.lang writes the numbers out: change it with the effects. Recipe.Input is what it costs to cook; Meats is any raw meat, a Wild Turkey's included. The dish is good all year; only the recipe is feast-only.",
